# Five players: a bound checked from the table to the limit

A symmetric table on three hats for five players, found by a search on
2026-11-28 (`research/hats/playersn/results/n5-t3-5944.txt`).  Lean's
kernel counts its wins, `5944` out of `32768` (`winsN_five3`), and the
theorem on repeated resets gives the limit
`5943 / 28806 = 1981 / 9602 = 0.206311...` (`tendsto_five3`), above the
`205447 / 1012494 = 0.202911...` of Buhler, Freiling, Graham, Kariv,
Roche, Tiefenbruck, Van Alten and Yeroshkin (`five3_gt`).
-/

